889e-ed47b29b782c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。RubyのMAJORとMINORは1桁になってるみたいですね。TEENYは2桁になることがあるよと。","ts":"1618475249.155000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qr655"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91113ee6-9f2a-44de-8e65-e15b2222f359","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくは `git tag | sort -Vr | head` みたいな感じでよく使います。","ts":"1618474872.154700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qyv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c9f71e3-e1cf-4792-97a3-ff8391d52ce0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"CI(GitHub Action)とかの関係で、わりと使うようになった、便利よね sort -V","ts":"1618474740.154000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VMJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be70bcd7-04f5-4049-8596-c826fa31d832","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"毎回がんばって比較してたよ・・・","ts":"1618474645.152800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"grin","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5SrZn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9696902-b968-4074-93d3-2bc5861ce427","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"sort -V知らなかった！","ts":"1618474621.152500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YCu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8e8ff99-1e37-40ba-9ab4-fba5dbdcc4ae","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"AtomとCeleronは世代が分かりにくい気がする","ts":"1618474618.152400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+nZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbac9eb3-5f86-4ae7-a5e3-379affd01e34","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いまとなっては `sort -V` 案件ですなぁ。","ts":"1618474595.151700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WnE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fe02145-0ac9-4372-b073-829c3f5a8bf2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`{世代}{i番号3,5,7,9}{リビジョン?2桁}{バリエーション:英字}`","ts":"1618474542.151000","thread_ts":"1618474362.145700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C3vS"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"03f5bb8b-a872-4ed3-826f-6ddf00744855","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ちなみに私はIntelCPUがわからない。\u003c#C016J5KFARM|hobby-gadget\u003e でみんな話してるときに毎回ググる","ts":"1618474362.145700","thread_ts":"1618474362.145700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"48S2"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"3da63d75-ea31-4fa7-a325-4ebc7c60eacf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.ruby-lang.org/ja/news/2013/12/21/ruby-version-policy-changes-with-2-1-0/\u003e\n\u0026gt; `MAJOR`: `MINOR` リリースで対応できない互換性のない変更がある場合に増加する。\n\u0026gt; 特別なイベントのために予約される。\n\u0026gt; `MINOR`: クリスマスごとに増加する。 API レベルでの非互換がありえる。\n\u0026gt; `TEENY`: API 互換性を維持するセキュリティフィックスやバグフィックス。\n\u0026gt; `2.1.11` のように10以上の値になりえる。2、3ヶ月おきにリリースされる。\n\u0026gt; `PATCH`: 直前の `MINOR` リリースからのコミット数。 (`MINOR` がリリースされるごとに 0 に戻る)\n","ts":"1618474541.150900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c3213e5-9fb5-42af-8e6f-a7360b0fb983","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ソースを探すのに時間がかかってしまった。\nRubyは絶対にRuby ver10にならないというのをまつもとさんがおっしゃっています。\n\u003chttps://www.itmedia.co.jp/enterprise/articles/0612/28/news025_2.html\u003e\n\nただ、この話は今は変わってそうだなぁ。。\n\u0026gt; まつもと　2桁以上を許してしまうと、バージョン番号をアルファベット順でソートしたときに、Ver.1.1の次が、Ver.1.2ではなく、Ver.1.10になってしまうので（笑）。ということで、Rubyで用いるバージョン番号は1桁にすると宣言しているわけです。","ts":"1618474515.150500","attachments":[{"fallback":"ITmedia エンタープライズ: まつもとゆきひろ――第2回：Rubyを開発するということ","id":1,"title":"まつもとゆきひろ――第2回：Rubyを開発するということ","title_link":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/enterprise/articles/0612/28/news025_2.html","text":"周囲がま